OL,3,GNEWSACrowds gather for first glimpse of
OL,4,AKing Charles in Preston
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles is making a visit to
OL,7,FLancashire
OL,9,FHe will make a number of stops during
OL,10,Fthe day, including to cultural venues
OL,11,Fand food producers
OL,13,FThe King was last in the county in
OL,14,FFebruary, when he visited Clitheroe
OL,16,FToday's visit will mostly focus on the
OL,17,FPreston area
OL,19,FAmong his many titles and stylings, the
OL,20,FKing is also the Duke of Lancaster
